<p>In universe, I'm not sure that would work, actually. Think about if you were an aspiring video producer and film critic, and some randos online ask you to shut down your channel. Would you do it? I'd guess probably not, and certainly not soon enough for the Foundation. The Foundation could reveal themselves as the powerful organization that they are to convince the being, but keep in mind that they don't know enough about this dimension to figure out whether that would come to bite them back in the ass; hence, the aggression.</p>
